you can check out Bit Defender using the

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:11.680
link below. Now the next trait I've seen

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:13.520
in successful people is learn to listen.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:16.000
And I would say for the first 5 years of

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:18.000
my business life, 15 to 20, this was not

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.360
a skill I had. I was busy building a

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.440
gardening company. I was trying to build

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:23.280
a hotel booking business. I was telling

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:25.120
people what to do all the time, but I

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:27.199
didn't listen to customers. I didn't

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.520
listen to my team. I didn't listen to

00:05:27.199 --> 00:05:31.440
general feedback. And I think I had a

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:33.120
worse business for it. And it was only

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:35.440
when I met someone called Helen Griffith

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:37.039
who basically came with me to a meeting

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:38.400
where she did nothing but listen for the

00:05:37.039 --> 00:05:40.000
whole meeting. And I did nothing but

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.520
talk. And at the end of the meeting, she

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.880
told me all the body language or the

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:44.720
psychology, all the things that people

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:47.039
were saying when I was talking that she

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:49.280
listened. And when I listened to her,

00:05:47.039 --> 00:05:51.120
she could explain to me all the things I

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.240
missed. All the cues, all the reasons

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:54.080
that people weren't going to buy the

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:55.919
services I was pitching were all because

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:58.160
she was listening, I was talking.

00:05:55.919 --> 00:06:00.160
Learning to listen is a skill. You have

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:02.240
to be silent even when you think you've

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:03.680
got something to say. Simon SK always

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:06.319
talks about this. It's like great

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:08.080
leaders, they speak last. You let

00:06:06.319 --> 00:06:09.520
