00:08:58.959 --> 00:09:02.560
like my purpose. So if you can leverage

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.640
a problem in the world that bothers you

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.880
to help you follow through it will help.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:09.360
My company fluid was not an overnight

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:11.040
success. It took me 15 years to take

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.040
