00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:18.560
follow through. Even when I got bored,

00:09:16.959 --> 00:09:21.040
even when I found it hard dealing with

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:22.560
some companies, even when I was tired,

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:24.399
when I felt like I couldn't do it

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:25.920
anymore, I still got up and did it. Now,

